    "detailed_description": "<h1>Stay Connected!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/4ea656452c2161863b4c3e9980385fda.poster.avif?t=1754673265\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/4ea656452c2161863b4c3e9980385fda.webm?t=1754673265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/4ea656452c2161863b4c3e9980385fda.mp4?t=1754673265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Snap Quest</strong>, a cozy photo adventure, you\u2019re called back to Star Island to h\u0336\u0313\u0349e\u0334\u034a\u032dl\u0336\u0309\u0358\u0319p\u0335\u0302\u033c\u00a0 your grandmother reclaim her lost research. Years of work mysteriously lost.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an island researcher and wildlife photographer. <strong>Solve clever puzzles</strong>, <strong>snap photos of never-before-seen creatures</strong>, and s\u0337\u0350\u0324a\u0335\u0311\u0319v\u0338\u034c\u033be\u0337\u0309\u0328\u00a0 your discoveries in your very own scientific journal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore </strong>t\u0336\u0344h\u0338\u0346\u0319e\u0335\u031a\u031f i\u0335\u0350\u033as\u0336\u0310\u0333l\u0336\u031b\u0330a\u0338\u0344\u0345n\u0334\u030c\u0353d\u0335\u0309\u0329 with your unique style. Decorate, rebuild, and shape the island's future. Along the way, meet quirky locals, form lasting friendships, and uncover the truth behind the disappearing research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/0b13590326bdb65e5e62961e4b9e342c.poster.avif?t=1754673265\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/0b13590326bdb65e5e62961e4b9e342c.webp?t=1754673265\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Camera to document your findings! Find and upgrade camera components to uncover lost scientific discoveries!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/5324b5fa8e936de3e363ab5048d602e4.poster.avif?t=1754673265\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/5324b5fa8e936de3e363ab5048d602e4.webp?t=1754673265\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through diverse environments, day and night, to experience the strange wildlife first hand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/441a539d46a4991bee76e0fae9daba94.poster.avif?t=1754673265\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/441a539d46a4991bee76e0fae9daba94.webp?t=1754673265\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends with the residents and they may assist you in your journey. Perhaps something more may bloom from your relationships.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/14b2e487442f8b370059de77d97f0e5d.poster.avif?t=1754673265\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/14b2e487442f8b370059de77d97f0e5d.webm?t=1754673265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W\u0338\u0305\u0326\u033ae\u0338\u035b\u033f\u0350\u0318\u032a\u031c\u00a0d\u0335\u0312\u0351\u0312\u0320\u032fo\u0338\u0350\u0312\u0324\u031cn\u0334\u0344\u0307\u0346\u0322'\u0336\u030e\u030f\u034et\u0338\u034a\u0352\u0321\u0359\u0331\u00a0h\u0336\u0346\u0344\u0358\u0333\u032c\u035ca\u0335\u0340\u031f\u0321\u0355v\u0336\u030f\u0315\u0345\u032e\u032ae\u0336\u0344\u031b\u0341\u0328\u0322\u00a0m\u0338\u030e\u034c\u0345\u0333\u0318u\u0337\u0344\u033b\u033a\u0324c\u0334\u035d\u0312\u0350\u0345\u035ch\u0338\u0344\u0359\u0320\u0317\u00a0t\u0338\u0350\u0343\u0312\u0359i\u0336\u0358\u0333m\u0334\u030f\u032c\u032c\u0329e\u0338\u0302\u032b\u0326\u00a0a\u0338\u0301\u0310\u034b\u0320\u033b\u031en\u0337\u0311\u0360\u0323\u0318\u0345d\u0337\u0300\u0351\u030d\u0318\u00a0I\u0335\u034b\u0360\u034e\u031e\u0324\u00a0d\u0335\u0309\u030c\u0339\u0333o\u0336\u0341\u0300\u031dn\u0335\u035b\u0311\u030a\u032d\u0325\u031e'\u0336\u0306\u0340\u034c\u032a\u0318t\u0336\u0352\u034d\u00a0k\u0336\u031a\u0315\u0345\u035cn\u0338\u030c\u0314\u034b\u0349o\u0337\u0313\u0315\u035d\u034dw\u0336\u030d\u0306\u0311\u0347\u0318\u00a0i\u0338\u0344\u0350\u0327\u031df\u0335\u0301\u032e\u00a0t\u0338\u0300\u033f\u0344\u033c\u0354h\u0335\u0314\u0325\u0359\u0325i\u0334\u0306\u0312\u0359s\u0338\u0360\u030a\u0344\u0320\u0324\u034e\u00a0w\u0338\u0350\u0302\u0322\u032f\u0321i\u0337\u030b\u0318\u0332l\u0336\u0306\u0328\u032b\u033al\u0335\u031a\u0344\u0349\u0327\u0327\u00a0r\u0335\u035b\u0355\u0324e\u0337\u0312\u0316\u0319a\u0338\u0302\u0308\u033e\u0322c\u0336\u035d\u0326\u0359h\u0337\u0304\u034a\u0303\u031d\u031f\u00a0y\u0336\u030e\u031c\u032fo\u0337\u0301\u035d\u0306\u0326u\u0335\u0312\u034c\u0350\u0324\u0331.\u0334\u0350\u0353\u00a0T\u0337\u0341\u030c\u0345\u0317\u032fh\u0337\u035d\u034a\u0358\u031f\u0359e\u0335\u033e\u03